</script><template><div class="site"><div class="top-note">领养代替购买，让陪伴从这里开始 <span>ADOPT LOVE. GIVE A HOME.</span></div><header class="header"><div class="shell nav"><RouterLink to="/" class="brand" @click="menu=false"><img src="/assets/paw.svg" alt=""><span>寻爪<small>PET HAVEN</small></span></RouterLink><nav :class="{open:menu}" aria-label="主导航" @click="menu=false"><RouterLink to="/" exact-active-class="active">首页</RouterLink><RouterLink to="/pets" active-class="active">寻找新伙伴</RouterLink><RouterLink to="/shop" active-class="active">宠物好物</RouterLink><RouterLink v-if="session.user" to="/adoptions" active-class="active">我的领养</RouterLink><RouterLink v-if="session.user?.role==='ADMIN'" to="/admin" active-class="active">管理中心</RouterLink></nav><div class="nav-actions"><RouterLink to="/cart" class="icon-link" aria-label="购物车"><Icon name="bag"/></RouterLink><template v-if="session.user"><RouterLink to="/account" class="account-link"><span class="avatar">{{session.user.nickname?.slice(0,1)}}</span><span>{{session.user.nickname}}</span></RouterLink><button class="text-button exit" @click="logout">退出</button></template><RouterLink v-else to="/login" class="btn small">登录 / 注册 <Icon name="arrow" :size="16"/></RouterLink><button class="icon-link menu-button" aria-label="展开导航" @click="menu=!menu"><Icon name="menu"/></button></div></div></header><main><RouterView/></main><footer><div class="shell footer-main"><div><RouterLink to="/" class="brand"><img src="/assets/paw.svg" alt=""><span>寻爪<small>PET HAVEN</small></span></RouterLink><p>每一次相遇，都值得被认真对待。<br>为小生命找到家，也为陪伴准备好一切。</p></div><div><h4>一起开启陪伴</h4><RouterLink to="/pets">寻找新伙伴</RouterLink><RouterLink to="/pets/new">发布领养信息</RouterLink><RouterLink to="/shop">发现宠物好物</RouterLink></div><div class="footer-promise"><Icon name="heart" :size="30"/><h4>认真领养，负责一生</h4><p>请充分沟通，确认养宠条件。<br>本平台不提供宠物交易与运输服务。</p></div></div><div class="shell footer-bottom"><span>© 2026 寻爪 Pet Haven · 软件工程课程项目</span><span>教学演示数据 · 商城支付均为模拟</span></div></footer><div v-if="flash" class="toast" :class="{danger:flashError}" role="status">{{flash}}</div></div></template>
